export anchor GridArea:
    description:
        Places the child into a named area from grid-template-areas, or sets its row start, column start, row end and column end lines, in that order.

    identifier: gridArea

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `grid-area` property.

    values:
        - `auto`
        - `<area-name>`
        - `<row-start> / <column-start> / <row-end> / <column-end>`

    initial: auto

    appliesTo: Grid items (children of a grid container).

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            gridArea: sidebar
        \\\
        ```
